OL,3,GNEWSAA1 closed as police examine
OL,4,A'suspicious vehicle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A1M in Cambridgeshire has
OL,7,Fbeen closed in both directions with a
OL,8,Fcordon in place in the area as police
OL,9,Fdeal with a "suspicious vehicle".
OL,11,FPolice said the vehicle was in the
OL,12,FGlatton area - north of Sawtry - and
OL,13,Fspecialist officers were at the scene.
OL,15,FA 400m cordon has been put in place as
OL,16,Fa precaution, they said.
OL,18,FSurrounding roads have been shut,
OL,19,Fincluding the A1M in both directions
OL,20,Fbetween Brampton and Haddon. Motorists
OL,21,Fare being advised to avoid the area.
